# Sethos Tighnari Fischl Lanyan. ~18s Rot. Sethos Tighnari Aggravate. Sethos uses a Shadowpiercing at the start of the rotation and after his burst, which is wrapped by skills for energy reasons. Tighnari uses burst after 1 CA, energy permiiting. Fischl alternates skill and burst. Lanyan swirls electro before after and Sethos with skill or burst. AGAIN, Sethos uses his burst.

# Team - Options Listed by DPS
